  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "For non-programmers like myself, Udon is an absolute nightmare to try and use. CyanTrigger is the only reason I was able to make worlds in the first place, and while it still works for the time being, it'll inevitably break someday now that it's no longer being maintained as the game updates.\n\nPlease look into implementing a simple, visual/dropdown-based creation system for worlds similar to this plugin and the old SDK2 VRCTrigger system it mimics. Udon is probably great for programmers, but for those of us with no such skillset or knowledge it's anything but. More options for simple world creation would only further expand accessibility for players to make worlds, which is only a good thing. For people like me, a system like this is a massive help in making simpler worlds, like avatar collections and basic exploration/hangout maps.",
